<header><p class="st-kicker">tribal confederation · Iberia</p><h1 class="st-title">Turmodigi</h1><p class="st-meta">300 BCE – 29 BCE (approx.) · capital Segisamo</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A people of the upper Arlanzón in Burgos, whose town Segisamo served as Augustus' base in the Cantabrian Wars.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Turmodigi, or Murbogi, lived around the upper <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arlanzon-river">Arlanzón</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pisuerga">Pisuerga</a> in modern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/burgos">Burgos</a> province from the later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iron-age">Iron Age</a>, between the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/vaccaei">Vaccaei</a>, <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/autrigones">Autrigones</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/cantabri">Cantabri</a>. Their language was probably Celtic.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Little is known of their society. Their main settlement was <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasamon">Segisamo</a>, modern Sasamón, and they farmed the northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/meseta-central">Meseta</a> and herded in its uplands.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>In 26 BCE <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/augustus-roman-emperor">Augustus</a> made <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasamon">Segisamo</a> his camp for the campaign against the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/cantabri">Cantabri</a>, and the Turmodigi were integrated into <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/hispania-tarraconensis">Hispania Tarraconensis</a>. Segisamo continued as a Roman town.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="tribal confederation, 300 BCE – 29 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="44" cy="56" rx="16" ry="24"/><path d="M44 34 V78"/><path d="M68 20 V84"/><path d="M68 20 L63 30 H73 Z"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">tribal confederation</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Iberia</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:53.73%;width:5.39%"></span></div><div class="st-span